      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i'm looking into some stuff for my cafe. we're in a pretty rural area where rent is cheap but everything's tight. how do changes in the minimum wage laws typically affect small businesses in low-cost-of-living areas?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
